<title>INDIA: India RBI raises 5.35 bln rupees at repos auction.</title>
<headline>India RBI raises 5.35 bln rupees at repos auction.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said it set a cut-off interest rate of 5.25 percent at a repo auction held on Monday.</p>
<p>RBI said it accepted bids for 5.35 billion rupees at Monday's auction.  </p>
<p>The RBI said it received 16 bids for 6.20 billion rupees, of which it accepted 12 bids for 5.35 billion rupees.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
